\begin{equation}
  \label{eq:102.5}
  L\mapsto \widetilde L: \Addinf(B) \to \bHomex(\Ahatab,\Ab),\tag{5}
\end{equation}
where $\bHomex$ denotes the category of \emph{exact} (hence additive)
functors from an abelian category to another one.

